    "detailed_description": "You are in charge of the last tower on Earth, against an army of alien invaders. Use your skills wisely in combat, and make smart choices in the shop, as you are humanity's last hope.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/b204f32e620ff591b17bdb0b2aad5c0d.poster.avif?t=1754292153\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/b204f32e620ff591b17bdb0b2aad5c0d.webm?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/b204f32e620ff591b17bdb0b2aad5c0d.mp4?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/dac8d04f1055a8cac96eb0d4e2d2bbcd.poster.avif?t=1754292153\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/dac8d04f1055a8cac96eb0d4e2d2bbcd.webm?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/dac8d04f1055a8cac96eb0d4e2d2bbcd.mp4?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is the free version of the full game <strong>Towerful Defense: A Rogue TD</strong>, which means it only gives you part of the whole experience and feature set. In this prologue, you will get:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast run roguelike tower defense (about 30 minutes for a run) with 19 normal waves and a partial boss wave. <br></li><li>3 Towers with different buffs, and play-style-changing effects<br></li><li>3 Skills with upgrades, enhancements, and unique traits<br></li><li>100+ artifacts and support units to help you craft unique powerful builds<br></li><li>Auto Skill with customizable targeting behaviors</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/08c9ebd319d2ffecadc29645d48a853c.poster.avif?t=1754292153\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/08c9ebd319d2ffecadc29645d48a853c.webm?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/08c9ebd319d2ffecadc29645d48a853c.mp4?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/93a0089ba2605dc860002c1a9d1fb8d7.poster.avif?t=1754292153\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/93a0089ba2605dc860002c1a9d1fb8d7.webm?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/93a0089ba2605dc860002c1a9d1fb8d7.mp4?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.poster.avif?t=1754292153\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.webm?t=1754292153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949250/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.mp4?t=1754292153\" 